and Unim, Brigid and Unnikrishnan, Bhaskaran and Upadhyay, Era and Usman, Jibrin Sammani and Vacante, Marco and Vahabi, Seyed Mohammad and Vaithinathan, Asokan Govindaraj and Valizadeh, Rohollah and {Van den Eynde}, Jef and Varavikova, Elena and Varga, Orsolya and Vart, Priya and Varthya, Shoban Babu and Vasankari, Tommi Juhani and Vellingiri, Balachandar and Venugopal, Deneshkumar and Verghese, Nicholas Alexander and Verma, Madhur and Veroux, Massimiliano and Verras, Georgios-Ioannis and Vervoort, Dominique and Villafane, Jorge Hugo and Vinayak, Manish and Violante, Francesco S. and Vishwakarma, Mukesh and Vladimirov, Sergey Konstantinovitch and Vlassov, Vasily and Vo, Bay and Volovat, Simona Ruxandra and Vos, Theo and Vujcic, Isidora S. and Wafa, Hatem A. and Waheed, Yasir and Wakwoya, Elias Bekele and Wang, Cong and Wang, Denny and Wang, Fang and Wang, Shu and Wang, Yanzhong and Wang, Yuan-Pang and Ward, Paul and Wassie, Emebet Gashaw and Watson, Stefanie and Weaver, Marcia R. and Weerakoon, Kosala Gayan and Weiss, Daniel J. and Wells, Katherine M. and Wen, Yi Feng and Westerman, Ronny and Wiangkham, Taweewat and Wickramasinghe, Dakshitha Praneeth and Wickramasinghe, Nuwan Darshana and Willeit, Peter and Wondimagegene, Yohannes Addisu and Wu, Felicia and Xia, Juan and Xiao, Hong and Xu, Gelin and Xu, Suowen and Xu, Xiaoyue and Yadollahpour, Ali and Yaghoobpoor, Shirin and Yaghoobpour, Tina and Yaghoubi, Sajad and Yahaya, Zwanden Sule and Yang, Danting and Yang, Lin and Yano, Yuichiro and Yaribeygi, Habib and Ye, Pengpeng and Yesodharan, Renjulal and Yesuf, Subah Abderehim and Yezli, Saber and Yigezu, Amanuel and Yip, Paul and Yon, Dong Keon and Yonemoto, Naohiro and You, Yuyi and Younis, Mustafa Z. and Yousefi, Zabihollah and Yu, Chuanhua and Yu, Yong and Yuan, Chun-Wei and Zafari, Nima and Zakham, Fathiah and Zaki, Nazar and Zamagni, Giulia and Zandi, Milad and Zandieh, Ghazal G. Z. and Zangiabadian, Moein and Zastrozhin, Mikhail Sergeevich and Zhang, Haijun and Zhang, Meixin and Zhang, Yunquan and Zhong, Chenwen and Zhou, Juexiao and Zhu, Bin and Zhu, Lei and Zielinska, Magdalena and Zou, Zhiyong and Zyoud, Samer H. and Murray, Christopher J. L. and Smith, Amanda E. and Vollset, Stein Emil},
  year = 2024,
  month = may,
  journal = {Lancet},
  volume = {403},
