  annotation = {Web of Science ID: WOS:001378952500001\\
TLDR: A procedure to derive an optimal temporal and an optimal spatial bandwidth for MGTWR is described and a formula for the effective number of parameters in the model is developed and also develops a formula for the ENPs in the model.},
